<title>CANADA: Interfor names Robert Sitter as new CEO.</title>
<headline>Interfor names Robert Sitter as new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Forest Products Ltd said on Tuesday that president Robert Sitter was named to replace William Sauder as chief executive officer of the company effective May 1.</p>
<p>Sauder, who is retiring after 24 years with the forest company, will continue as its chairman. Sitter has worked at Interfor since 1975 and has been president and chief operating officer since 1991.</p>
</text>
